{
 "about": "Golden recurrence cases for mvCalendar. Inputs are hand-written; every `expect` is generated by scripts/recurrence_golden.py with python-dateutil (an independent RFC 5545 implementation) and checked by the Go reference expander (internal/recur) and CalendarKit's expander. Timed starts are local wall-clock times in time_zone; expect holds UTC instants (timed) or dates (all-day). take = how many occurrences to compare (the series may end sooner). Semantics: internal/recur/expand.go.",
